## 2. Event Driven

Everything revolves around events.

### Examples

- Click Event
- HTTP Request Event
- File Read Event

---

## 3. Non-Blocking

Node.js does not stop execution while waiting for tasks.

---

## 4. Fast

Powered by the V8 Engine.

Machine code execution makes it very fast.

---

## 5. Scalable

Handles thousands of concurrent requests efficiently.

