## Q10. Difference Between process.nextTick() and setTimeout()?

### process.nextTick()

- Executes before the Event Loop continues
- Higher priority

### setTimeout()

- Executes during the Timers Phase
- Lower priority

### Example

```js
console.log("Start");

process.nextTick(() => {
  console.log("nextTick");
});

setTimeout(() => {
  console.log("timeout");
}, 0);

console.log("End");
```

### Output

```text
Start
End
nextTick
timeout
```

